    <bpmn:process id="W_W4683" name="W4683. Executive Transport, Convoy &amp; Route Security" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Principal/executive movement
Frequency: Per movement
Volume: ~ daily principal movements + event movements
Owner: EP Lead / Transport Security Manager
Participants: EP-trained drivers, EP agents, GSOC (W4676), fleet (VS-06)
Source: workflow W4683 — Executive Transport, Convoy &amp; Route Security</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4683_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4683_Lane1" name="Transport Security Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4683_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4683_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4683_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4683_Lane2" name="EP Agents">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4683_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4683_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4683_Start4" name="Principal/executive movement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4683_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4683_Task5" name="Operate the executive-transport program: EP-trained and vetted drivers…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Operate the executive-transport program: EP-trained and vetted drivers, armored/reinforced vehicles where warranted, route planning (primary/alternate/evacuation), and convoy procedures for high-threat movements
Responsible (R): Transport Security Manager / EP
Accountable (A): CSO
Duration: Per movement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4683_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4683_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4683_Task6" name="Execute movements with route monitoring (GSOC W4676), counter-surveillance, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Execute movements with route monitoring (GSOC W4676), counter-surveillance, and contingency (breakdown, ambush, roadblock) drills; coordinate with law enforcement for high-profile movements where appropriate
Responsible (R): EP Agents / Driver / GSOC
Accountable (A): CSO
Duration: Per movement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4683_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4683_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4683_Task7" name="Maintain the executive fleet (acquisition, armoring, maintenance, comms)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Maintain the executive fleet (acquisition, armoring, maintenance, comms) distinct from the goods fleet (VS-06) and employee commute (VS-141); vet and train drivers continuously
Responsible (R): Transport Security Manager
Accountable (A): CSO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4683_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4683_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4683_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4683_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4683_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-708 (ensure controlled execution — Executive Protection, Principal Travel &amp; Event Security (PA-159.2).) | - CTL-708: vetted/trained drivers; route variation + counter-surveillance; executive fleet maintained
Owner: EP Lead / Transport Security Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
