      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Principal residence setup; threat-level change; periodic review
Frequency: Per residence + periodic review
Volume: ~5–10 principal residences/estates
Owner: CSO / Residential Security Manager
Participants: EP (W4681), guard force (W4677), facilities/smart-home tech, principals&#x27; households
Source: workflow W4685 — Residences, Estate &amp; Perimeter Security for Principals</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4685_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4685_Lane1" name="Residential Security Manager">
