        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-708 (ensure controlled execution — Executive Protection, Principal Travel &amp; Event Security (PA-159.2).) | - CTL-708: residential security scaled to threat profile; location privacy (VS-91); household-staff vetting
Owner: CSO / Residential Security Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
