    <bpmn:process id="W_W4688" name="W4688. Employee Travel Risk, Lost-Contact &amp; Medical-Evacuation Coordination (Duty of Care)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Traveler lost-contact, medical emergency, or destination crisis during a trip
Frequency: Rare (preparedness continuous)
Volume: ~ hopefully rare incidents; 1 medevac/lost-contact protocol
Owner: GSOC Manager / CSO (joint with HR/OH VS-83)
Participants: HR (VS-19), Occupational Health (VS-83), medical-evac provider, insurance (VS-26), family, law enforcement/embassy
Source: workflow W4688 — Employee Travel Risk, Lost-Contact &amp; Medical-Evacuation Coordination (Duty of Care)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4688_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4688_Lane1" name="GSOC Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4688_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4688_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4688_Lane2" name="GSOC">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4688_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4688_Lane3" name="CSO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4688_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4688_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4688_Start5" name="Traveler lost-contact, medical emergency, or destination crisis during a trip">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4688_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4688_Task6" name="Maintain the lost-contact/medical-evacuation protocol: trigger thresholds…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the lost-contact/medical-evacuation protocol: trigger thresholds (missed check-in, destination crisis, medical event), escalation, medical-evac provider engagement, and family liaison
Responsible (R): GSOC Manager / CSO / OH
Accountable (A): CSO / CHRO
Duration: Continuous readiness</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4688_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4688_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4688_Task7" name="On a lost-contact/medical event: activate the protocol, locate the traveler…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: On a lost-contact/medical event: activate the protocol, locate the traveler (tracking W4687), engage medical-evac and insurance (VS-26), support family, and coordinate with local authorities/embassy for international incidents
Responsible (R): GSOC / OH / HR / Medevac
Accountable (A): CSO / CHRO
Duration: Per incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4688_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4688_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4688_Task8" name="Conduct post-incident review; support the employee&#x27;s return/recovery (VS-83)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Conduct post-incident review; support the employee&#x27;s return/recovery (VS-83); adjust travel-risk intelligence (W4679) and protocols
Responsible (R): CSO / OH / HR
Accountable (A): CSO / CHRO
Duration: Post-incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4688_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4688_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4688_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4688_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4688_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-708 (ensure controlled execution — Executive Protection, Principal Travel &amp; Event Security (PA-159.2).) | - CTL-708: lost-contact thresholds + escalation; medevac provider pre-engaged; duty-of-care documentation
Owner: GSOC Manager / CSO (joint with HR/OH VS-83)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4688_Assoc11" sourceRef="W4688_Annotation10" targetRef="W4688_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4688_Flow12" sourceRef="W4688_Start5" targetRef="W4688_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4688_Flow13" sourceRef="W4688_Task6" targetRef="W4688_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4688_Flow14" sourceRef="W4688_Task7" targetRef="W4688_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4688_Flow15" sourceRef="W4688_Task8" targetRef="W4688_End9" />
    </bpmn:process>
